\f1\fs22 Sarah and Tony got into bed together, an arrangement Sarah was more at ease with than Tony, because Tony hoped there would be sex and Sarah knew there would be none. In spite of either\'92s degree of ardor, they fell asleep as soon as the moth-eaten pillowcases caressed their ears.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Shortly before sunrise, the potion Kleoboulos gave Sarah excited her dream state, as well as parts more corporeal. She squirmed and tossed, and breathed heavily, as a dream lover ravished her. She moaned as he targeted her breast, and sucked as hungrily and forcibly as a starving infant might.
\f3\i  
\f1\i0 In slack-mouthed gratification, Sarah looked down to behold her dark-lover\'92s face, and saw Tony sucking on her chest raisin.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>She woke in an instant. Tony was snoring beside her, yet the sucking sensation persisted. To Sarah\'92s horror, the Gyges Disc\'97which she had hidden in her bra from both Johnny and Special Agent Jones\'97had come alive, and transformed into some carnivorous slug consuming her tit. She recoiled and flicked at it, but it remained as resolutely glued to her. She squealed, which roused Tony.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91What the tax?\'92 he spurted when he saw Sarah\'92s plight. 
\f3\i Nice breasts
\f1\i0 , he thought.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Get it off! Get it off!\'92 Sarah was terrified.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony picked at the disc without discerning a clean edge, as if it had melted and was fusing with Sarah\'92s flesh. \'91It\'92s stuck!\'92 he cried in mounting panic. 
\f3\i Nice, flat belly too
\f1\i0 . As he tried to prise it away, it stretched between his fingers like soft toffee.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Just pull it off me, please, before it buries under my skin.\'92 She stifled a wail.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony straddled Sarah and worked all ten of his digits around the circumference of the disc. Without warning, it went cold, and solidified enough for Tony peel it away.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah exhaled deeply. Some of the colour returned to her face. If she possessed the coherent breath to speak, she would have said the exact thing as Tony: \'91Oh, thank tax!\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Then Tony roared, and his eyes boggled at the thing now gluing itself to his fingers. An involuntary spasm shook his hand vigorously until the disc lost adhesion, and took a parabolic arc toward the wall by the door.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>The wall shook the door shook the floor shook the bed rattled the windows punched the ceiling dropped an inordinate amount of dust on Sarah and Tony\'92s bodies.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony coughed. \'91Jesus taxing Christ.\'92 He fell flat on the bed by Sarah. \'91What is that thing?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Heaven and Hell on a biscuit,\'92 Sarah answered, through gulps to prevent her vomiting.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We gotta get rid of it,\'92 Tony said as he rolled on his back and allowed his frame to relax. \'91Just leave it here.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91We can\'92t,\'92 Sarah said through tears.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Why the tax not?\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Agent Jones wants it. He\'92ll never believe we just threw it away. He\'92ll kill us.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91He\'92ll kill us anyway. And probably donate our minced bodies to FitzBurgers.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Sarah cried. Tony repressed his own tears, and thus nurtured whatever cancers fed best on machismo.\
